  Simple enough to keep doing

  Most training logs ask for weight, reps, rest and effort on every set. That
  detail is useful, but it is also why so many people stop logging. PureSets
  tracks one thing: how many hard sets each muscle got this week.

  Simplicity enables consistency, and consistency is what builds muscle.

  What counts as a hard set
